{"id":"n48193-3-8","stage":3,"title":"되살아나다 · 重现","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n48193-3-8-1","ko":"아직도 자동차를 타는 게 무서워?","zh":"你现在还害怕坐车吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아직도","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아직도","audio":"/audio/902d7e7542f94724da66.mp3"}},{"text":"자동차를","meaning":"汽车","explanation":"자동차：汽车；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"자동차","audio":"/audio/716907a2f49c42607a15.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70799","senseId":"1","lemma":"자동차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자동차를","audio":"/audio/40a619f27aae6cd52450.mp3"}},{"text":"타는","meaning":"乘，乘坐","explanation":"타다：乘，乘坐；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17160","senseId":"1","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"타는","audio":"/audio/798479a558d3170caf71.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"무서워?","meaning":"怕，害怕，可怕，恐惧","explanation":"무섭다：怕，害怕，可怕，恐惧；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"무섭다","audio":"/audio/6c5692ebced898c0376c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55637","senseId":"1","lemma":"무섭다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무서워","audio":"/audio/921bc08fcad14842acb2.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"716907a2f49c4260","term":"자동차","zh":"汽车","audio":"/audio/716907a2f49c42607a15.mp3","entryId":"70799","definition":"用引擎的力量转动轮胎，在道路上行驶的车。","pronunciation":["자동차"]},{"id":"8f835109fdc29a59","term":"타다","zh":"乘，乘坐","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3","entryId":"17160","definition":"坐到交通工具或当作交通工具的动物背上。","pronunciation":["타다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"6c5692ebced898c0","term":"무섭다","zh":"怕，害怕，可怕，恐惧","audio":"/audio/6c5692ebced898c0376c.mp3","entryId":"55637","definition":"忌讳某个对象或担心出什么事。","pronunciation":["무섭따"]}],"audio":"/audio/3160777eace9e7c27df5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n48193-3-8-2","ko":"응, 차만 타면 사고 당시의 고통이 되살아나서 괴로워.","zh":"嗯，一上车就想起事故时的痛苦，很难受。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"차만","meaning":"车，车辆","explanation":"차：车，车辆；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"차","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62525","senseId":"1","lemma":"차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"차만","audio":"/audio/a4a5cdf9dc6cce120c45.mp3"}},{"text":"타면","meaning":"乘，乘坐","explanation":"타다：乘，乘坐；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17160","senseId":"1","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"타면","audio":"/audio/e6787c8aeca044fdc74a.mp3"}},{"text":"사고","meaning":"事故","explanation":"사고：事故","readings":[{"term":"사고","audio":"/audio/2b04ea5b795422b77c61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66370","senseId":"1","lemma":"사고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사고","audio":"/audio/2b04ea5b795422b77c61.mp3"}},{"text":"당시의","meaning":"当时，那时","explanation":"당시：当时，那时；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"당시","audio":"/audio/53613ed0216550ac6d00.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14259","senseId":"1","lemma":"당시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"당시의","audio":"/audio/dd94cd1d2e2d1d364c49.mp3"}},{"text":"고통이","meaning":"痛苦","explanation":"고통：痛苦；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"고통","audio":"/audio/84e22bc49fad97e980cc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18380","senseId":"1","lemma":"고통","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고통이","audio":"/audio/feba33b1bd4e9886a8d7.mp3"}},{"text":"되살아나서","meaning":"重现，复现","explanation":"되살아나다：重现，复现；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"되살아나다","audio":"/audio/bf22795317c4b659056d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48193","senseId":"3","lemma":"되살아나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되살아나서","audio":"/audio/3e261d0c6888bdd47674.mp3"}},{"text":"괴로워.","meaning":"痛苦，难过","explanation":"괴롭다：痛苦，难过；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"괴롭다","audio":"/audio/1197b28135aa8853eb33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30850","senseId":"1","lemma":"괴롭다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"괴로워","audio":"/audio/08ad0e36816b522ddc2e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"6ccd3f82b0317e51","term":"차","zh":"车，车辆","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3","entryId":"62525","definition":"搬运人或行李的带轮子的机械。","pronunciation":["차"]},{"id":"8f835109fdc29a59","term":"타다","zh":"乘，乘坐","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3","entryId":"17160","definition":"坐到交通工具或当作交通工具的动物背上。","pronunciation":["타다"]},{"id":"2b04ea5b795422b7","term":"사고","zh":"事故","audio":"/audio/2b04